        <mxCell id="legend" value="C4 palette (standard §C4 archetype palette):  dark blue = owned container · cylinder = datastore container · gray = external system · navy = person · dashed box = system boundary.&#xa;Relationship labels name the protocol/tech in brackets. One archetype per diagram (no trust-zone colours — anti-mixing rule)." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#444444;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;strokeColor=#cccccc;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1">
